# The lyrics tier (P6, M26): WhisperX on top of the stems set.
#
# Resolved with the stems lock as constraints (setup/steps/python-env.ts), so every package the two
# share keeps its stems version: installing this tier never changes stem separation. The pinned
# lock is requirements-lyrics.lock.txt, generated by `npm run setup -- --relock` and committed.
#
# Two things WhisperX does not declare, found by running it on the RTX machine (STATUS §4.55):
#  - ctranslate2 is overridden to 4.8.2 (manifest PYTHON_PACKAGES_LYRICS.overrides): WhisperX pins
#    <4.5, and those need cuDNN 8, which cannot sit beside torch's CUDA 13 build (cuDNN 9).
#  - nvidia-cublas-cu12 provides the CUDA 12 cuBLAS that CTranslate2 is built against.

-r requirements.in
whisperx==3.4.5
nvidia-cublas-cu12
